# ADR 0003 - Core Contract Version 1 And The Amendment Procedure

**Status:** Proposed

**Date:** 2026-08-27

**Core contract:** version 1 (contract-bearing)

**Core contract version:** 7

**Minimum supported version:** 4

Violates E1: the header fields disagree with the VmCoreContract constants, which is exactly the
drift between documentation and code that E1 exists to stop.
